  "reason": "The native APEX Supporting Objects clean installation completed100 migrations, then the deployment-request index postcondition failed with ORA-20301. Oracle correctly represents the TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE first key as a function-based SYS_EXTRACT_UTC index; the original verifier incorrectly required NORMAL and the visible STARTED_AT key. The seven-step suffix was not accepted. The replacement verifies the exact native expression and key order without rebuilding an existing index.",
